                                     "text":  "The interior smelled strongly of cooking oil.\n\nThe dishes we ordered didn\u0027t seem to be the restaurant\u0027s signature items, so they were only average.\n\nThe only standout was the French toast, which was delicious and very eggy.\n\nThe coffee was smooth, almost like a beverage.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "內用的油煙味滿重。\n我們點的餐點似乎不是店家招牌，所以表現只能說是中規中矩。\n唯一驚豔的是法式吐司，很好吃，蛋香十足。\n咖啡滿順口，像飲料。",
